    "innovation": "This paper presents the first continuous climate record of the Eemian interglacial from a folded Greenland ice core, demonstrating that a strong warming (8 \u00b1 4 \u00b0C) caused only a modest ice-sheet thinning, constraining the Greenland ice sheet\u2019s contribution to past sea-level rise.",
